{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     home/marquee — where I would like to do this work.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     ⚠ DUMMY CONTENT. The company list is a placeholder until it is real.

     This is NOT a customer logo wall, and it must not be allowed to look like
     one. NSDS's archetype uses .ns-marquee for "learners at Acme Cloud" —
     social proof — and the same component with company names in it reads as a
     client list by default. The kicker and the lede carry the whole
     distinction, so if either is ever trimmed the band starts making a claim
     that is not true.

     ── THE SECOND TRACK IS NOT A DUPLICATE BY ACCIDENT ──────────────────────
     A marquee loops by running two identical tracks back to back and
     translating the pair; when the first scrolls out the second is already in
     place, so there is no gap and no jump. The copy is aria-hidden because a
     screen reader must not read the list twice.

     NSDS pauses the animation under prefers-reduced-motion — a horizontally
     scrolling strip is the textbook vestibular trigger — so nothing here has
     to handle that.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<section class="ns-band ns-band--tight ns-band--sunken">
    <div class="ns-band__inner">
        <div class="ns-band__head ns-band__head--center">
            <span class="ns-kicker">{{t "Open to work"}}</span>
            <h2 class="ns-band__title">{{t "Teams I would love to build GTM engineering with"}}</h2>
            <p class="ns-band__lede">{{t "Not clients, and not endorsements — a list of places whose product and go-to-market I have spent real time learning."}}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ns-marquee ns-marquee--window ns-marquee--slow">
            <div class="ns-marquee__track">
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Salesforce</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Vercel</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Linear</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Stripe</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Supabase</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Ghost</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Anthropic</b></span>
            </div>
            <div class="ns-marquee__track" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Salesforce</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Vercel</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Linear</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Stripe</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Supabase</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Ghost</b></span>
                <span class="ns-marquee__item"><b>Anthropic</b></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
